372 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This study compared DCGAN and a Diffusion Model for face image synthesis on the CelebA dataset. While DCGAN produced acceptable images, it showed instability and lower visual quality. The Diffusion Model generated sharper, more realistic outputs and achieved better FID and IS scores, demonstrating greater stability and fidelity. Overall, diffusion models outperform DCGAN for high-quality image generation.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [1]
>>
